Republican Kentucky Senator Rand Paul did

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:14.049
yesterday on Newsmax TV with host Greg Kelly.

00:00:14.049 --> 00:00:18.150
And he really makes a complete fool of himself.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.640
And there's something very interesting happening
with Rand Paul.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.849
You might remember that Rand Paul kind of
became buddies with Donald Trump while Donald

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:25.849
Trump was president.

00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:30.890
They would play golf and increasingly Rand
Paul would defend the things that Donald Trump

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:31.890
